---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {services,url} from '../data';
---
<Layout title="Contact & Free Estimate" description="Discuss your construction or remodeling project. Call (669) 222-9922 or prepare an email to info@siliconvalleygbc.com."><section class="page-heading section"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</p><h1>Let’s make<br/><em>room for possibility.</em></h1></section><section class="contact-layout section"><aside><p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL CONVERSATION</p><h2>Tell us what<br/>you’re <em>imagining.</em></h2><p>Share a little about your property and plans. The company can discuss next steps and a free estimate.</p><a class="contact-link" href="tel:+16692229922">(669) 222-9922 ↗</a><a class="contact-link email" href="mailto:info@siliconvalleygbc.com">info@siliconvalleygbc.com ↗</a><div class="office"><p class="eyebrow">PUBLISHED OFFICE ADDRESS</p><address>2100 Geng Rd, STE 210<br/>Palo Alto, CA 94303</address><p class="caption">Published California license #1033491.<br/>License status not independently verified.</p></div></aside><form id="estimate-form" novalidate><p class="form-note">This independent concept has no submission backend. Complete the form to prepare an email in your mail app; nothing is sent automatically.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Full name <span>*</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="name-error"/><small id="name-error" class="field-error"></small></label><label>Email <span>*</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required aria-describedby="email-error"/><small id="email-error" class="field-error"></small></label><label>Phone <span>*</span><input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required aria-describedby="phone-error"/><small id="phone-error" class="field-error"></small></label><label>City or ZIP code <span>*</span><input name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" required aria-describedby="city-error"/><small id="city-error" class="field-error"></small></label><label>Project type <span>*</span><select name="service" required aria-describedby="service-error"><option value="">Select a service</option>{services.map(s=><option value={s.slug}>{s.title}</option>)}<option value="other">Other / Let’s discuss</option></select><small id="service-error" class="field-error"></small></label><label>Preferred timeline<select name="timeline"><option>Exploring possibilities</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>3–6 months</option><option>6–12 months</option><option>Flexible</option></select></label><label class="full">Project description <span>*</span><textarea name="description" rows="5" required aria-describedby="description-error" placeholder="Your space, your priorities, your vision…"></textarea><small id="description-error" class="field-error"></small></label></div><p class="caption">Your entries stay in this page until you choose to open your email app. <a href={url('privacy/')}>Privacy details</a></p><button class="button dark-button" type="submit">Prepare project email <span>↗</span></button><div id="form-status" role="status"></div><div id="email-preview" hidden><h3>Your project email</h3><pre></pre><a class="button dark-button" id="open-email" href="mailto:info@siliconvalleygbc.com">Open email app ↗</a><button type="button" id="copy-email" class="text-link">Copy email text</button><p class="caption">Review and send it in your email app. If no app opens, copy the text and email it to info@siliconvalleygbc.com.</p></div></form></section></Layout>
